@startuml

actor "Admin" as Adm
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as FE
participant "AdminAuditController" as API
database "audit_logs" as DB

Adm -> FE: Chọn "Nhật ký hệ thống"
FE -> API: GET /api/v1/admin/audit\n?actorId=&action=&entityName=&from=&to=&page=1&limit=50
note right of FE
  Endpoint đổi từ /audit/logs → /admin/audit
  Tất cả filter trong 1 endpoint (không tách endpoint riêng)
  page là 1-indexed
end note
API -> DB: findAll(filters, pageable, sort=createdAt DESC)
DB --> API: PaginatedResponse<AuditLogResponse>
API --> FE: 200 PaginatedResponse<AuditLogResponse>
FE --> Adm: Danh sách audit logs\n(actorName, action, entityName, createdAt)

opt Lọc theo Action
    Adm -> FE: Chọn AuditAction từ dropdown
    FE -> API: GET /api/v1/admin/audit?action={action}&page=1&limit=50
    API --> FE: Filtered logs
end

opt Lọc theo diễn viên (actor)
    Adm -> FE: Nhập actorId (userId)
    FE -> API: GET /api/v1/admin/audit?actorId={actorId}&page=1&limit=50
    API --> FE: Filtered logs
end

opt Lọc theo khoảng thời gian
    Adm -> FE: Chọn from → to
    FE -> API: GET /api/v1/admin/audit?from={from}&to={to}&page=1&limit=50
    API --> FE: Filtered logs
end

note right of API
  AuditAction values:
  USER_CREATED, USER_UPDATED, USER_LOCKED, USER_UNLOCKED,
  BANK_INFO_UPDATED, ROLE_ASSIGNED, ROLE_REVOKED,
  DEPARTMENT_CREATED, DEPARTMENT_UPDATED,
  QUOTA_TOPUP, QUOTA_ADJUSTED, CONFIG_UPDATED,
  SYSTEM_FUND_ADJUSTED, PROJECT_TOPUP,
  CATEGORY_BUDGET_UPDATED, PIN_RESET, PIN_LOCKED,
  USER_LOGIN_SUCCESS, USER_LOGIN_FAILED,
  DATA_EXPORTED, MANUAL_ADJUSTMENT
end note

@enduml
